This rule is the Cursor stub installed by `nodrift init --agents cursor`; it points Cursor at this repository's governance locations.

Read `AGENTS.md` at the repository root as the constitution and treat its rules as binding; every rule ends at a link to its detailed home.

Decision notes live in `.agents/notes/`; the format, lifecycle, and classification rules are in `.agents/notes/README.md`. Record durable decisions as notes there, never in chat.

Agent skills (pre-push-checks, code-review, agent-notes, prose-standard, find-simplifications, trim-cot-leakage) live in `.agents/skills/`; read the matching skill before you act on its trigger. Run the narrowest `nodrift check` before pushing.
